#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "File Manager"
msgstr "Gestionari de fichièrs"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this module, you can configure various aspects of &konqueror;'s file "
"manager functionality."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konqueror;'s web browser functionality has its <ulink url=\"help:/kcontrol/"
"khtml/index.html\">own configuration modules</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Use</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The configuration options for the file manager are organized under tabs as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Appearance</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tab contains options for customizing the appearance of &konqueror; "
"windows, such as the default font text color."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Behavior</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "This tab contains a couple of &konqueror; global options."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Previews</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "On this tab, you can customize when &konqueror; should show previews."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Appearance</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following settings determine how text and colors are displayed in "
"&konqueror; File Manager mode windows."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Standard font:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the font used to display text such as file names in &konqueror; "
"windows."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Font size:"
msgstr "Talha de la poliça :"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lets you control the size of text, while the <guilabel>Standard Font</"
"guilabel> setting determines the font face used."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Normal text color:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid "Determines the standard text color."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Height for icon text:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The maximum number of lines that can be used to draw icon text. Long lines "
"are truncated at the end of the last line."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can still see word-wrapped filenames by pausing the mouse pointer over "
"the icon."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Width for icon text:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The maximum width for the icon text when &konqueror; is in multi-column view "
"mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid "Underline filenames:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When <guilabel>Underline filenames</guilabel> is checked, filenames will be "
"underlined so that they look like links on a web page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display file sizes in bytes:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The final check box on this page determines how &konqueror; displays file "
"sizes, when you are in one of the file manager modes that normally shows "
"this information. If you check the <guilabel>Display file sizes in bytes</"
"guilabel> box then file sizes are always shown in bytes. If you leave it "
"unchecked then file sizes are shown in bytes, kilobytes or megabytes, "
"depending on their size."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Behavior</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "Misc Options"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Open folders in separate windows"
msgstr "Obrir los repertòris dins de fenèstras separadas"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, a new &konqueror; window will be created when you "
"open a folder, rather than simply showing that folder's contents in the "
"current window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show network operations in a single window"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If unchecked, and you download a file, a dialog box will appear that shows "
"the status of the download."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:156 index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Download Dialog Box</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:160 index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Download Dialog Box</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid "Individual Download Dialog Box"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you start a new transfer, another dialog box will appear. (&Netscape; "
"users will be familiar with this behavior)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked, all transfer status windows will be grouped together under a "
"single dialog box."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "Collected Download Dialog Box"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose to use the Collected download dialog box, you can delete "
"transfers by clicking once on the transfer you want to cancel, then clicking "
"the <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> Button on the left."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show file tips"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can control if, when moving the mouse over a file, you want to see "
"a small popup window with additional information about that file."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show previews in file tips"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can control if the file tip should show a thumbnail preview of the "
"file."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "Home URL"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the &URL; (&eg; a folder or a web page) where &konqueror; will jump "
"to when the <guibutton>Home</guibutton> button is pressed."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The default is the users home folder, indicated with a <literal>~</literal>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can set a path that is your <guilabel>Home URL</guilabel> by typing into "
"the text field, or using the <guiicon>browse</guiicon> icon. The default is "
"<literal>~</literal> which is a standard shortcut for your $<envar>HOME</"
"envar> folder. When you choose the <guiicon>home</guiicon> icon on your "
"panel, in a file open or save dialog, or from within &konqueror; in file "
"manager mode, this is the folder you will be shown."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Ask confirmation for</guilabel> setting tells &konqueror; what "
"to do when you choose to <quote>Delete</quote>, <quote>Trash</quote>, or "
"<quote>Shred</quote> a file in a &konqueror; window. If any box is checked, "
"&konqueror; asks for confirmation before performing the corresponding action."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Previews</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konqueror; has a preview feature for many file types, including "
"<acronym>HTML</acronym> files, images, &PostScript; and <acronym>PDF</"
"acronym>, sound, web archives (if you have the appropriate &konqueror; "
"plugin installed) and text files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you enable previews for one of these, files of that particular file type "
"will not be represented by standard icons in the filemanager, but will "
"instead be shown as miniature previews. On slow computers, the previews can "
"take some time to show up, so you might not want to enable this feature."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this module you can specify which <quote>protocols</quote> you wish the "
"previews to be available for. Creating the previews requires that "
"&konqueror; download at least part of the file, in order to create the "
"preview. &konqueror;, like the rest of &kde; is entirely network "
"transparent, and will treat a remote &FTP; folder just as if it was on your "
"local hard drive. This can result in a delay, especially if you are viewing, "
"for example, a folder full of images over a slow network connection."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For each protocol, you can independently enable or disable previews. For "
"example, you might enable previews for <acronym>NFS</acronym> mounted drives "
"if you have a fast network, but disable them for &FTP; because your Internet "
"connection is via a modem."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can further refine the maximum size file that &konqueror; will attempt "
"to show a preview for. The default is 1 MB. In other words, by default, if a "
"file is 900 kB in size, and the protocol you are viewing the folder with is "
"enabled, then &konqueror; will create a preview icon for it. If the file is "
"1.1 MB in size, &konqueror; will not make a preview, even if the protocol is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can turn on and off previews <quote>on the fly</quote> from within "
"&konqueror;, using the <guimenu>View</guimenu> menu. For example, if you "
"normally want to see image previews on every protocol, but find a particular "
"server is very slow to send you the data, you might turn it off for the "
"present, and turn it on again later."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You may also like to enable the checkbox <guilabel>Increase size of previews "
"relative to icons</guilabel>, in order to see more information in the "
"thumbnails."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many image files already contain a thumbnail. You can enable the "
"<guilabel>Use thumbnails embedded in files</guilabel> to make use of these. "
"This will save time waiting for thumbnails to be created when viewing a "
"folder full of images you have not previously seen in &konqueror;."
msgstr ""
